OL,3,GNEWSAA38 reopens after multi-vehicle
OL,4,Acrash
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe A38 in Derbyshire has reopened
OL,7,Ffollowing a collision involving six
OL,8,Fvehicles.
OL,10,FPolice said the southbound carriageway
OL,11,Fof the A38 between Coxbench and Little
OL,12,FEaton was closed, in a Facebook post on
OL,13,FMonday morning.
OL,15,FA spokesperson for Derbyshire Fire and
OL,16,FRescue Service said it was called to
OL,17,Fthe scene at 06:31 BST and firefighters
OL,18,F"made the scene safe".
OL,23,APub: 05-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,363,360,200,160,0,100
