OL,3,GNEWSAA38 reopens after multi-vehicle
OL,4,Acrash
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe road has since reopened, however,
OL,7,Fthe highways agency warned of ongoing
OL,8,Fdelays of up to 70 minutes on the
OL,9,Fapproach to the scene with seven miles
OL,10,Fof congestion.
